    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:ward_drum",
      "text": [
        "A camp's night watch. The Ward Drum spends Pulse to strike and shove one hostile at a time, so a creeper never reaches your door. It never targets players."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What it hits",
      "text": [
        "On each beat, once a second, it finds one hostile within **8 blocks** (a cube around the drum) and hits it for **4 magic damage** with a shove away from the drum.",
        "Each strike costs **8 Pulse** from a generator within 8. Ranking shortens the beat; Pulse per strike stays 8.",
        "Players are never the target, and neither are familiars bonded to you or young ones."
      ]
    },
