      "type": "text",
      "title": "Living with it",
      "text": [
        "Right-click it to see what it last struck. A lever silences it.",
        "It is a guard, not a farm: one strike a second will not keep up with a spawner. If the deaths should pay you back, set a Wake Bell within 16 blocks of where they fall.",
